# Hand-written Netlify redirects. The build adds more after these (scripts/prerender.mjs): a rewrite that
# serves each wine page at its genzwithaglass.com address, then the portfolio's moved addresses.

# Gen Z With A Glass lives at genzwithaglass.com (see wineDomain in src/site.ts). Its old addresses move there:
# www, and the wine section's /wine links on either domain. The ! applies a rule even where a file exists.
https://www.genzwithaglass.com/*   https://genzwithaglass.com/:splat   301!
http://www.genzwithaglass.com/*    https://genzwithaglass.com/:splat   301!
https://arynlynn.com/wine          https://genzwithaglass.com/         301!
https://arynlynn.com/wine/*        https://genzwithaglass.com/:splat   301!
https://genzwithaglass.com/wine    https://genzwithaglass.com/         301!
https://genzwithaglass.com/wine/*  https://genzwithaglass.com/:splat   301!

# genzwithaglass.com's own robots.txt and sitemap.
https://genzwithaglass.com/robots.txt   /robots-wine.txt   200!
https://genzwithaglass.com/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-wine.xml  200!
